      "finding": "All five before images show complete Listo separately below native navigation and apart from Back or Cancelar. All five after images show no keyboard or Listo. Geometry confirms editor/sheet retained, 115.333 by 63.333 point Done frame, a contained 44 by 44 region and five sparse center/top/bottom/left/right samples. Done begins 8 points below navigation."
